@startuml
title Model setup — clean install → opt-in download → recognition enabled

actor "User" as user
participant "App.tsx\n(model setup loop)" as app
participant "Models dialog\n(ModelSetupDialog)" as dialog
participant "indigo-server\ntransport/models" as api
participant "service/ml\ndownloader + catalog" as downloader
participant "Hugging Face" as hf
participant "Ketcher option store" as store

== First launch ==
app -> api: GET /v2/models
api --> app: 200 { ready: false, installed_bytes: 0, ... }
app -> api: GET /v2/info
api --> app: imago_versions: [] (capability not advertised)
app -> dialog: auto-open once because the install is not ready
app -> app: show the Models toolbar entry (setup needs attention)
user -> dialog: read the intro and the two model families
user -> dialog: Later

== Opt-in download ==
user -> dialog: reopen from Models, choose Download
dialog -> api: POST /v2/models/download
api --> dialog: 202 status body, download.state = downloading
api -> downloader: spawn the background run
downloader -> downloader: preflight free disk space for remaining bytes
alt not enough space
  downloader -> downloader: fail the run with required and available bytes
  dialog -> api: next GET /v2/models poll
  api --> dialog: status with download.state = failed
  dialog --> user: actionable error, Retry
else space available
  loop each artifact in catalog order
    downloader -> downloader: skip a final file with matching size and SHA-256
    downloader -> hf: GET <url> with Range: bytes=<part length>-
    hf --> downloader: 206 partial body (or 200/416, which restarts)
    downloader -> downloader: append to <path>.part
    downloader -> downloader: verify size and SHA-256
    alt mismatch
      downloader -> downloader: delete the .part, keep the previous final file, fail
    else match
      downloader -> downloader: atomic rename .part to the final path
    end
  end
  downloader -> downloader: verify the installed set, write manifest.json last
end

== Progress and cancellation ==
loop while download.state is downloading or verifying
  dialog -> api: GET /v2/models every 500 ms
  api --> dialog: state, bytes, percent, current_file
  note right of dialog
    ready, failed and cancelled
    end the poll and update
    the action row.
  end note
end
opt user cancels while downloading
  dialog -> api: POST /v2/models/download/cancel
  api --> dialog: 202 with download.state = cancelled
  note right of downloader
    The .part files are kept.
    The next Download/Resume
    continues from them.
  end note
end

== Recognition enabled without a remount ==
app -> api: GET /v2/models
api --> app: ready: true, installed_bytes == total_bytes
app -> api: GET /v2/info
api --> app: imago_versions: ["local-ocsr"]
app -> store: APP_OPTIONS, UPDATE, no-op ACTION
store --> app: Recognize control recomputed and enabled
app -> dialog: hide the Models control once the install is healthy
dialog --> user: Later closes the dialog; the canvas and undo history survive

@enduml
